Package: infernet
Title: Inferential Models for Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2025-06-23
Description: Provides inferential tests and regression models for network
    data.  Implements conditional uniform graph (CUG) tests, quadratic
    assignment procedure (QAP) tests, and multiple regression QAP (MRQAP)
    with Dekker's double semi-partialling, supporting a variety of model
    families (gaussian, binomial, Poisson, negative binomial,
    zero-inflated Poisson, and multinomial) and estimation methods
    (OLS, GLM, mixed models via lme4 / glmmTMB, fixed effects via fixest,
    and GMM).  The package integrates with the stocnet ecosystem, accepting
    any manynet-compatible network object and any scalar network measure
    from manynet, netrics, or migraph as a test statistic.
URL: https://stocnet.github.io/infernet/
BugReports: https://github.com/stocnet/infernet/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
